{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207320","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1720732001:1":{"text":"艾雅在上，几位是……？","source_cn":"艾雅在上，几位是……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED985422F382F341","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720732002:1":{"text":"我们在街上遇到了这几个孩子，他们无家可归，还被坏人欺负。我想问问……教堂能不能收留他们？","source_cn":"我们在街上遇到了这几个孩子，他们无家可归，还被坏人欺负...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C06A0C44337B154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720732003:1":{"text":"这……唉，可怜的孩子们。","source_cn":"这……唉，可怜的孩子们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x567FA57A2EF33BFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720732004:1":{"text":"最近流浪的孩子越来越多了，已经到了教堂的人手远远不够照顾的程度，再多几个孩子，我怕……","source_cn":"最近流浪的孩子越来越多了，已经到了教堂的人手远远不够照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x847C7A2C2E312553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720732005:1":{"text":"这、怎么会这样……连教堂也……","source_cn":"这、怎么会这样……连教堂也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD5546B2FA4E6B5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_s